<h1>CapacityConnect — Complete AI-Assisted SDLC Deliverables</h1>
<div class="callout">
  <b>Project Title:</b> CapacityConnect — Digital Capacity Building & Competency Governance Ecosystem<br>
  <b>Evaluation Scope:</b> Execution of a complete Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) using Artificial Intelligence (AI)<br>
  <b>Theme:</b> Smart Education & Organizational Competency Development (MoES / IMD - SIH 26075)<br>
  <b>Deliverables Sequence:</b> 4 Solutions in Order (Requirements ➔ Architecture ➔ Implementation ➔ Testing & Deployment)
</div>

