<h3>4.3 Deployment & Execution Commands</h3>
<pre>
# Install and run backend:
cd server && npm install && npm run dev

# Install and run frontend:
cd client && npm install && npm run dev

# Run automated end-to-end tests:
npx playwright test
</pre>

<h3>4.4 Role-Based Operational Walkthrough</h3>
<ol>
  <li><b>Super Admin:</b> Monitors national training metrics, approves institutions, reviews audit logs.</li>
  <li><b>Institute Admin:</b> Manages college departments, uploads student rosters via Excel batch ingestion.</li>
  <li><b>Trainer:</b> Builds interactive modules, conducts assessments, reviews grade distribution.</li>
  <li><b>Trainee:</b> Takes courses, completes anti-cheat exams, earns certified credentials with live QR codes.</li>
  <li><b>Public / Employer:</b> Scans certificate QR code to immediately verify credential authenticity.</li>
</ol>

